    {
      "text": [
        {
          "card": true,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "icon": "page"
                },
                {
                  "boldText": "Lesson 2 • Bob Returns Home With Bad News"
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "Bob tells his wife Susan that he lost his job.Susan suggests that he start his own business."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "card": false,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Susan: "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "What’s the matter"
                },
                {
                  "text": ", dear?"
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Bob: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Susan, I "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "got canned"
                },
                {
                  "text": " today at work."
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Susan: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "But Bob, you were Peter’s "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "right-hand man"
                },
                {
                  "text": "!"
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Bob: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Yes, and he "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "stabbed me in the back"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Susan: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Keep your "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "chin up"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". Maybe he’ll "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "change his mind"
                },
                {
                  "text": " and take you back."
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Bob: "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "When pigs fly"
                },
                {
                  "text": "! Once he "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "makes up his mind"
                },
                {
                  "text": ", he never changes it. Besides, I "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "told him off"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Susan: "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "Look on the bright side"
                },
                {
                  "text": ": you won’t have to "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "set eyes on"
                },
                {
                  "text": " Peter ever again."
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Bob: "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "Thank goodness"
                },
                {
                  "text": " for that!"
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Susan: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Hang in there"
                },
                {
                  "text":	". I’m sure you won't be "
                },
                {
                  "markedText":	"out of work"
                },
                {
                  "text":	" for long."
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Bob: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "In the meantime, we’ll have to "
                },
                {
                  "markedText":	"live from hand to mouth"
                },
                {
                  "text":	"."
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Susan: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Don’t get too "
                },
                {
                  "markedText":	"stressed out"
                },
                {
                  "text":	", Bob. We’ll "
                },
                {
                  "markedText":	"make ends meet"
                },
                {
                  "text":	"."
                }
              
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Bob: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I can always get a job at McDonald’s as a "
                },
                {
                  "markedText":	"last resort"
                },
                {
                  "text":	"."
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Susan: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I don't think they’re hiring right now."
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Bob: "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "If worse comes to worst"
                },
                {
                  "text":	", we can sell our home and move into a tent."
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Susan: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Let’s "
                },
                {
                  "markedText":	"think big"
                },
                {
                  "text":	"! Maybe you can start your own business."
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            },
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Bob: "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "Easier said than done!"
                }
              ],
              "lineBreak": true
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
